  "details": "So, I think what yall should add is a shop with premium currency and a free currency. Then, a role can be given out to creators for making games. After a \"game\" is completely, players are given regular \"coins\".\n\nPremium currency would be bought with real money.\n\nThe point of these would be used in a Shop tab in the menu, where you can browse avatars and possibly music in the background. Both, of which, anyone can upload.\n\nCreators can also choose whether or not to sell their stuff for regular coins or premium currency.\n\nMaybe we could call it... coins and bars? Like gold bars. Something to think about.",
